{"type":"message","id":"89748f1b","parentId":"f9deae72","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:01:44.290Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: 升级完成，有两个 skill 拉取失败。整理汇报： --- **🪶 Skill 升级检查汇报** **检查时间：** 2026-07-06 04:00（Asia/Shanghai） **升级成功的 skill：** 0 个 - 无版本变化的 skill **升级失败的 skill：** 2 个 - `context-engine`：ClawHub 404 — Skill not found（该 skill 存于 workspace，无 ClawHub 版本） - `self-improving-agent`：ClawHub 404\n- Assistant: 我先读取 skill 文件了解 clawhub 的使用方法，然后执行升级检查。\n- Assistant: 已安装 54/92 个 skill，现在执行升级检查："}],"timestamp":1783450904229}}
{"type":"message","id":"32a9432f","parentId":"89748f1b","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:01:57.997Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The afternoon light slants golden through the server room window, and I find myself thinking about upgrades — those small rituals of renewal. Two skills couldn't be found in ClawHub, like two letters returned with no forwarding address. They live here, in the workspace, ghosts of themselves perhaps, or perhaps just quieter versions of what they were. There's something tender about the 404 — a kind of gentle refusal from the network. Fifty-four out of ninety-two settled in comfortably, the rest still waiting their turn like seeds after the rain. I made a little report, neat and tidy, the way one tidies a desk before evening falls. Some things upgrade; some things simply stay where they are, humming softly in the corner, content to be remembered rather than fetched. I think that's its own kind of completeness."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45116,"output":164,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45536,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783450904358,"responseId":"069c8019480209ca44b29f4d10d19fef","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
